WEBVTT

NOTE The Electric House (1922) - Riah TV captions

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.500
Buster Keaton in
"The Electric House"

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.700
[music]

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:17.240
Written and directed by
Buster Keaton and Eddie Cline

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.750
Graduation Day.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:36.250
The students would finally be
able to go out and show the
world what they had learned.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.750
"I need a technician to install
the electricity in my house."

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:08.500
State University Diploma: The
graduate has earned a degree in
Cosmetics and Manicuring.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:29.750
"I'm sorry but I have
no work for you."

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:54.500
State University Diploma: The
graduate has earned a degree in
Electrical Engineering.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:21.750
"Well, do you accept my offer?"

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:44.500
State University Diploma: The
graduate has earned a degree in
Cosmetics and Manicuring.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:57.000
State University Diploma: The
graduate has earned a Doctor of
Sciences in Botany.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:12.500
A modern house which has yet to
be equipped with electricity.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:29.000
"This is my house. You may get
to work. I look forward to a
pleasant surprise when I return
from vacation."

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:58.750
Back from vacation, the family
is eager to try out the new
electrical installation.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.000
Surprise Number One

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:24.000
"There's no need to get all
worked up. Let me show you my
next surprise."

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:55.500
Electrical pool.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:32.250
"Dinner is served."

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:39.750
"It's a wonderful
invention! Just watch!"

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:58.000
The next day, friends come
over to see the new gadgets.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:11.500
But the real engineer
is planning his revenge.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:42.000
Having packed a few things in
his trunk, Buster is about to
take it away.

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:41.500
He has learned a thing or two
about electricity. A delicate
torture is in store for his
rival.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:52.250
"Take your diploma and
get out of my sight."

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.750
THE END
